# Gemini: no automatic suspend when idle (2026-10-20). The SPM suspend still
# hangs at random (about one hang per ~17 min asleep with 2 s wake cycles),
# so an unattended idle suspend would often end in a hang and a drained
# battery. Suspend by the lid or the silver key only. 0 = no action.
# Remove once the hang is fixed (gemini-nixos docs/spm-sleep.md).
[AC][SuspendAndShutdown]
AutoSuspendAction=0

[Battery][SuspendAndShutdown]
AutoSuspendAction=0

[LowBattery][SuspendAndShutdown]
AutoSuspendAction=0
